  "usage_note": "**Half** is a noun in the uses shown here (*a half*, *in half*, *half past four*). Directly before a noun phrase (*half an hour*, *half the cake*) it is a determiner; in *half of them* it is a pronoun; in *half asleep* it is an adverb. Those uses have their own entries.",
